{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 13 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">配准与投影几何：可微变换、拓扑约束和 SE(3) 闭环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registration &amp; SE(3)</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_126_idir-title\">IDIR</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">IDIR 将位移场本身作为坐标神经场，并在测试图像对上直接优化，而不是由训练好的网络一次预测 flow。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Parameterizes the continuous 3D deformation field φ(x) = x + u_θ(x) for a single image pair directly as a coordinate-based Implicit Neural Representation (SIREN MLP) optimized at test time.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">一对 fixed/moving 图像及在图像域采样的连续坐标 x</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Continuous 3D spatial coordinates x ∈ [-1,1]³ sampled over a fixed/moving volume pair (I_f, I_m)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">可在任意坐标查询的连续位移场 uθ(x) 和 warped moving 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Resolution-independent continuous deformation field φ_θ(x) with exact autograd spatial derivatives</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v172/wolterink22a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_126_idir')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_126_idir')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"IDIR original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/91ce6ea3f319e93d4b10.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_126_idir\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_126_idir')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_126_idir\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Fixed 与 moving 图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Fixed moving</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">每一对病例单独优化，不需要跨病例预训练</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous 3d spatial coordinates x ∈ [-1,1]³ sampled over a fixed/moving volume pair (i_f, i_m) and prepares initial tensor representations (Fixed moving).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"每一对病例单独优化，不需要跨病例预训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests continuous 3d spatial coordinates x ∈ [-1,1]³ sampled over a fixed/moving volume pair (i_f, i_m) and prepares initial tensor representations (Fixed moving).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Fixed 与 moving 图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Fixed moving\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Fixed 与 moving 图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Fixed moving</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每一对病例单独优化，不需要跨病例预训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous 3d spatial coordinates x ∈ [-1,1]³ sampled over a fixed/moving volume pair (i_f, i_m) and prepares initial tensor representations (Fixed moving).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从归一化 2D/3D 空间采样 x\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes continuous sampling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"连续坐标采样\" data-node-name-en=\"continuous sampling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">连续坐标采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">continuous sampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从归一化 2D/3D 空间采样 x</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes continuous sampling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可将 x 映射到更高频的位置表示\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs feature within the core implicit coordinate mlp registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"坐标/傅里叶特征\" data-node-name-en=\"feature\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">坐标/傅里叶特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可将 x 映射到更高频的位置表示</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs feature within the core implicit coordinate mlp registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以 θ 表示连续函数 x→uθ(x)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Implicit coordinate MLP within the core implicit coordinate mlp registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Implicit coordinate MLP\" data-node-name-en=\"Implicit coordinate MLP\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Implicit coordinate MLP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以 θ 表示连续函数 x→uθ(x)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Implicit coordinate MLP within the core implicit coordinate mlp registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将 fixed 网格映射到 moving 采样位置\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs x+uθ(x within the core implicit coordinate mlp registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"坐标变换 x+uθ(x)\" data-node-name-en=\"x+uθ(x\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">坐标变换 x+uθ(x)</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x+uθ(x</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将 fixed 网格映射到 moving 采样位置</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs x+uθ(x within the core implicit coordinate mlp registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在变换坐标处查询 moving 强度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs differentiable moving interpolator within the core implicit coordinate mlp registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"可微 moving interpolator\" data-node-name-en=\"differentiable moving interpolator\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">可微 moving interpolator</span><span class=\"lang-en\">differentiable moving interpolator</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在变换坐标处查询 moving 强度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs differentiable moving interpolator within the core implicit coordinate mlp registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐病例反向传播更新 θ，可加 Jacobian、hyperelastic 或 bending 约束\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies + regularization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"图像相似度 + 形变正则\" data-node-name-en=\"+ regularization\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像相似度 + 形变正则</span><span class=\"lang-en\">+ regularization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐病例反向传播更新 θ，可加 Jacobian、hyperelastic 或 bending 约束</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies + regularization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"优化后可在任意分辨率查询并生成 warped image\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces resolution-independent continuous deformation field φ_θ(x) with exact autograd spatial derivatives via continuous deformation field.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"连续形变场\" data-node-name-en=\"continuous deformation field\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_126_idir', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">连续形变场</span><span class=\"lang-en\">continuous deformation field</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">优化后可在任意分辨率查询并生成 warped image</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces resolution-independent continuous deformation field φ_θ(x) with exact autograd spatial derivatives via continuous deformation field.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"IDIR Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 逐病例坐标神经场的连续配准优化</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Per-Pair Continuous Coordinate MLP Deformation Field Optimization with Analytical Jacobian Regularization</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"IDIR：核心公式 · 逐病例坐标神经场的连续配准优化\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"126\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"15.508734pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.52394 -69.000129 337.255194 15.508734\" width=\"337.255194pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.342399 0V-.158807C1.7